msgid "description"
msgstr "*Fichero* processes large collections of scanned documents—hundreds or even tens of thousands—by automatically cropping, enhancing, segmenting, AI-transcribing, and cataloging. It generates outputs in Word and Excel files.\n\nYou can [learn more](https://www.tubb.ca/fichero/) about how it works if you're interested, but the short version is that Fichero uses various tools to break down each step, calls Visual Large Language Models, and runs on various folders in parallel.\n\nTo get started, choose a folder to process using the button above."

